<br><br>That's why <b>we offer training demos at our Elgin location</b>. Russo brings in certified experts to teach you the ins and outs of rope maintenance.
<br><br>All locations have dedicated arbor sections full of cutting edge products to check out.</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-84_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-85_ pf-heading-3-h3">Safe for Trees</h3><p class="sc-bVVHAX cfQUSW pf-87_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We don't just hug trees, we love them. That's why we stock products and teach techniques built with tree care in mind.
<br><br><b>Did you know...?</b> Each puncture from a climbing spike produces a certain amount of tree tissue death. Usually, these wounds will heal, but over time, multiple spike holes can cause an entire area to die with no chance of recovery.<br><br>Keep trees safe by only using climbing spikes during tree removal, not pruning.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-a6da" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fbKhWw dHaUDq pf-89_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-dhFVuh jkEGqE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-90_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-91_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-92_ pf-heading-6-h2">Shop By Brand</h2></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-94_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-95_"><div data-pf-type="Slideshow" class="sc-fhzEvr iabUTU pf-96_"><div data-id="slider-8adec598-9fdc-48de-9d92-e7e3f4ba936b-all" class="pf-slider scrollfix" style="--ss-xs:1;--ss-sm:1;--ss-md:1;--ss-lg:1"><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-gNXsgQ eYDYVq pf-97_ pf-bg-lazy" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-98_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-99_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/t/25/assets/petzllogo-1685127814805_150x.png?v=1685127817" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/t/25/assets/petzllogo-1685127814805.png?v=1685127817 1536w" width="251" height="121" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-